## Proof Thresholds

| Sent | Replies | Confirmed Pain | Status | Action |
|------|---------|---------------|--------|--------|
| 20   | >= 5    | >= 3          | PASSED | Continue to Step 4 |
| 20   | >= 5    | < 3           | WEAK   | Continue with warning |
| 20   | < 5     | any           | FAILED | Retry: different pain or different prey |

